<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Aug inflation 7.9 pct vs July 8.9.</title>
<headline>Philippine Aug inflation 7.9 pct vs July 8.9.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' inflation rate fell to 7.9 percent in August year on year from 8.9 percent in July, the National Statistics Office said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	    Aug 96  July 96   Aug 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change    +1.0	+0.1     +1.9</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change	    +7.9	+8.9     +8.4</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)   230.6     228.4     213.8</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8914 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
